{ In the Schlechter Slav we play g6 and Bg7. } { [%cal Bg7g6] }
1... g6 { [%csl Gg6][%cal Gg7g6] } 2. cxd5 { Recapture! } { [%csl Rd5][%cal Rc4d5] } 2... cxd5 { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gc6d5] } 3. Bf4 { Ok! Now, of course, we play Bb7, Nc6, e6, and get on with life. You can develop your c8-bishop at will. Then, castle, and this will be a good game for you. Super Solid! } { [%csl Rf4,Bg7,Bc6,Yh3,Yg4,Yf5,Ye6,Yd7][%cal Rc1f4,Bf8g7,Bb8c6,Yc8h3] } *

